            "review_title": "Review at CoCo Ichibanya Vietnam - Vincom Landmark 81",
            "review_text": "Anand1351\nSingapore, Singapore3894 contributions\n27\nBest - exceeded expectations\nNov 2022 • Couples\nWe went there after seeing Landmark 81 sky deck and just casually selected it without much expectations.\nAnd wow food was damn good, we ordered clam spinach and tomato curry and made it a meal.\nFresh and delicious.\nEnded with ice creams - I can say that food was much better than other Japanese restaurants in SEA.\nAnd restaurant interior is beautiful and staff service 5/5.\nRead more\nWritten November 29, 2022",
